            "description": "Implement various types of basic and advanced graphs and charts like: Waffle Charts, Area Plots, Histograms, Bar Charts, Pie Charts, Scatter Plots, Word Clouds, Choropleth Maps, and many more, including Advanced Visualizations, Geospatial Data.",
            "score": 8.79,
            "achievement": "excellent"
          },
          {
            "clo": "CLO5",
            "description": "Implement an application that leverages multiple Watson AI services, including Discovery, Speech to Text, Watson Assistant, and Text to Speech, with chatbot creation and integration in a final project context.",
